14ten                                             September 1812.</hi></dateline>                                     <lb/>
<signed><hi rendition="#c"><hi rendition="#aq #fr">(L.                                                 S.)</hi></hi><lb/>
<hi rendition="#c #fr"><hi rendition="#aq">Ad Mandatum                                                 Sereni&#x017F;&#x017F;imi                                             proprium.</hi><lb/>
Herzogl.                                             Mecklenburgi&#x017F;che zur                                                 Ju&#x017F;tiz-Kanzeley<lb/>
<hi rendition="#et">verordnete Director, Vice-Director                                             und</hi><lb/>
Räthe.</hi><lb/>
<hi rendition="#fr #right">v. Bülow.<space dim="horizontal"/>                                         <lb/>
